e/upload/t_thumb/sczyvc.jpg"}, {"id": 1678153, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczyvd.jpg"}, {"id": 1678154, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczyve.jpg"}, {"id": 1678155, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczyvf.jpg"}], "slug": "seasons-turning", "storyline": "You\u2019ve just turned 18. You're ready to leave the orphanage and start life as an independent adult. Your sister is over-the-moon excited to come with you. She wants to see what's out in the world, but she\u2019s still 13, and the matron informs you that you must prove you can support your sister before you can adopt her.\n\nYou need a stable income, a safe home, emotional maturity. Right now you\u2019re barely batting one of three.\n\nThe matron hands you a job advert. A recent widow needs help maintaining her land. It\u2019s far and barely pays, but it\u2019s a start. You\u2019ll have to work your way up before you and your sister can be reunited for good.", "summary": "A farming/life sim focused on exploration and immersion. There's no stamina bar and no broken tools. Aside from the genre's norms, it has four puzzle-filled dungeons, secret locations, irrigation, gene splicing, mafia kittens, and one rusty, well-loved bicycle. Save whenever. Play at your own speed.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/seasons-turning", "videos": [{"id": 165689, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IT7AXEfMYhk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IT7AXEfMYhk", "title": "Seasons Turning | Mid-Dev Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IT7AXEfMYhk/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}